---
name: cv-builder-dashboard-integration
description: Added CV builder access point to dashboard with dynamic linking to create/edit CV
metadata:
  type: project
---

Integrated CV builder into portfolio dashboard:
- Added CV builder button to dashboard page header alongside "Add project" button
- Button dynamically shows "Build CV" when no CV exists, "Edit CV" when CV exists
- Properly links to CV creation route (cvRoutes.create()) or edit route (cvRoutes.edit({ cv: metrics.cvId }))
- Dashboard controller sends cvId metric (null if no CV, CV ID if exists)
- Dashboard shows CV completion status in metrics section
- Uses existing routing and authentication systems
**How to apply**: Users can access CV builder directly from dashboard, with appropriate create/edit routing based on whether they already have a CV.